{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Unit Choice 是一款價格比較 App，讓你輸入每件商品的價格與數量，快速比較單位價格，適合日常購物時想避免漏看價差、數量差異或更優惠選擇的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-268.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>快速比較單位價格</h2>\n<p>輸入每件商品的價格與數量後，Unit Choice 會整理單位價格，即使尺寸、份量或包裝數量不同，也能快速查看最低選項、平均值與中位數。你可把記錄存入清單，日後重看，並在需要時再次比較同一批商品，減少購物時的疑慮。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-335-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-336-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-337-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-338-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-339-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-340-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Unit Choice</li><li>應用類別：Shopping</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/unit-choice/id6762347699?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T08:44:14.053669+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":263,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T08:34:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T10:37:35.115823+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T08:37:32.908556+00:00","content_hash":"4abcb4a7b1733507a90889fb8700169ff3cda36c10adee0a1606b1630fe4d535","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}